<title>GERMANY: GEA says H1 sales, orders higher.</title>
<headline>GEA says H1 sales, orders higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOCHUM, Germany 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				 1,891   vs 1,688</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   2,467   vs 2,284</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   17,000  vs 17,450</p>
<p>    Net debt (at June 30)		   328     vs 676</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German energy and environmental equipment group is Gea AG. Gea defines its net debt as financial debts after deduction of securities holdings and liquid assets.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
